---

<BaseLayout
	title="Latest Expedition"
	description="Burgos, Spain, 2026. Solar Wind Sherpas observed the total solar eclipse from Padilla de Abajo and Pico Trigaza."
>
	<article class="page exp">
		<section class="exp-screen" id="burgos-2026" aria-labelledby="exp-heading" data-header-hero>
			<div class="exp-screen-media">
				<Image
					src={burgosHorizon}
					alt="Tripods silhouetted against a low sun over a wide valley at Pico Trigaza"
					widths={[1200, 2000, 2800]}
					sizes="100vw"
					loading="eager"
					class="exp-screen-photo"
				/>
				<div class="exp-screen-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="exp-screen-copy">
				<p class="label page-kicker">Latest expedition · 2026</p>
				<h1 id="exp-heading">Burgos, Spain</h1>
				<p class="exp-facts">12 August 2026 · Padilla de Abajo · Pico Trigaza</p>
				<p class="exp-screen-lead">Two observing sites. One total solar eclipse.</p>
				<p class="exp-screen-credit">Pico Trigaza · Václav Široký, 2026</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="exp-block exp-sites" id="mission" aria-labelledby="mission-heading" data-burgos-filter>
			<div class="exp-sites-intro">
				<h2 id="mission-heading">Two sites, one eclipse.</h2>
				<div class="exp-sites-copy">
					<!-- Proposed editorial — validate scientific wording with Danilo before publish. -->
					<p>
						In Burgos, the Sherpas observed from two locations: Padilla de Abajo in the valley and Pico
						Trigaza on the ridge. Observing from more than one site improves the chances of clear skies
						and adds to the project’s growing record of the solar corona.
					</p>
					<p>
						With the eclipse only about eight degrees above the horizon, both teams needed a clear view
						unobstructed by the landscape.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="exp-sites-pair" data-lightbox-gallery aria-label="The two Burgos observing sites">
				{
					siteLeads.map((site) => (
						<figure class="exp-sites-shot" style={`--shot-pos: ${site.position}`}>
							<button
								type="button"
								class="exp-sites-shot-open"
								data-lightbox-trigger
								aria-label={`View larger: ${site.label}`}
							>
								<Image
									src={site.image}
									alt={site.alt}
									widths={[640, 960, 1400]}
									sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 46vw"
									loading="lazy"
									class="exp-sites-photo"
								/>
							</button>
							<figcaption class="exp-sites-caption" data-lightbox-caption-text>
								{site.label}
							</figcaption>
						</figure>
					))
				}
			</div>

			<div class="exp-gallery-head">
				<p class="exp-gallery-note">
					Filter by site. Each caption names the place and the photographer.
				</p>
				<div class="exp-gallery-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="Filter photographs by site">
					<button type="button" class="exp-site-btn" data-gallery-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">
						All
					</button>
					<button type="button" class="exp-site-btn" data-gallery-filter="padilla" aria-pressed="false">
						Padilla de Abajo
					</button>
					<button type="button" class="exp-site-btn" data-gallery-filter="trigaza" aria-pressed="false">
						Pico Trigaza
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="exp-burgos-carousel carousel" data-carousel data-lightbox-gallery>
				<div
					class="exp-burgos-gallery carousel-track"
					data-carousel-track
					data-burgos-gallery
					tabindex="0"
					role="list"
					aria-label="Burgos expedition photographs from Padilla de Abajo and Pico Trigaza"
				>
					{
						burgosGallery.map((shot) => (
							<figure
								class:list={['exp-burgos-shot', `exp-burgos-shot--${shot.size}`]}
								role="listitem"
								data-site={shot.site}
								style={`--shot-pos: ${shot.position}`}
							>
								<button
									type="button"
									class="exp-burgos-shot-open"
									data-lightbox-trigger
									aria-label={`View larger: ${shot.caption}`}
								>
									<Image
										src={shot.image}
										alt={shot.alt}
										widths={[480, 800, 1200, 1600]}
										sizes={
											shot.size === 'hero' || shot.size === 'wide'
												? '(max-width: 900px) 85vw, 48vw'
												: '(max-width: 900px) 78vw, 28vw'
										}
										loading="lazy"
										class="exp-burgos-photo"
									/>
								</button>
								<figcaption class="exp-burgos-caption" data-lightbox-caption-text>
									{shot.caption}
								</figcaption>
							</figure>
						))
					}
				</div>
				<div class="carousel-controls exp-burgos-carousel-controls">
					<p class="exp-burgos-carousel-hint">Swipe or use the arrows to browse</p>
					<div class="carousel-arrows">
						<button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-carousel-prev aria-label="Previous photographs">
							←
						</button>
						<button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-carousel-next aria-label="Next photographs">
							→
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		{
			hasFull && (
				<section class="exp-block exp-film exp-open" id="film" aria-labelledby="film-heading">
					<div class="page-narrow exp-film-copy">
						<p class="label">The film</p>
						<h2 id="film-heading">A film from Padilla de Abajo.</h2>
						<p>
							Filmmaker Santiago Marrodán Ciordia followed the Burgos 2026 campaign — a longer look at
							the people, the instruments and the days around totality in Padilla de Abajo.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="exp-hero" data-cut-switch>
						<div class="exp-hero-chrome">
							<button
								type="button"
								class="exp-hero-mute"
								data-exp-mute
								aria-label="Mute sound"
								aria-pressed="false"
							>
								<span class="exp-hero-mute-icon" data-exp-mute-icon aria-hidden="true">
									<svg class="exp-hero-mute-on" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none">
										<path d="M4 10.5v3h3.2L11 17V7L7.2 10.5H4Z" fill="currentColor" />
										<path
											d="M14.2 9.2a3.6 3.6 0 0 1 0 5.6M16.6 7a6.4 6.4 0 0 1 0 10"
											stroke="currentColor"
											stroke-width="1.7"
											stroke-linecap="round"
										/>
									</svg>
									<svg class="exp-hero-mute-off" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none">
										<path d="M4 10.5v3h3.2L11 17V7L7.2 10.5H4Z" fill="currentColor" />
										<path
											d="M15 9.5 20 14.5M20 9.5 15 14.5"
											stroke="currentColor"
											stroke-width="1.7"
											stroke-linecap="round"
										/>
									</svg>
								</span>
							</button>
							<button type="button" class="exp-hero-close" data-exp-close aria-label="Exit film">
								<span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
							</button>
						</div>
						<p class="exp-rotate-hint" data-exp-rotate-hint hidden>
							<span class="exp-rotate-hint-icon" aria-hidden="true">↻</span>
							<span class="exp-rotate-hint-text">Rotate for a larger view.</span>
						</p>
						<div class="exp-hero-frame">
							<div
								class="exp-hero-panel"
								data-exp-src={fullSrc}
								data-exp-src-light={fullSrcLight}
								data-exp-skip-start="5"
								data-exp-skip-tail="4.3"
								data-exp-preload="metadata"
							>
								<video
									class="exp-hero-video"
									data-exp-video
									playsinline
									webkit-playsinline
									preload="metadata"
									poster={fullPoster}
									aria-label="Burgos expedition film by Santiago Marrodán Ciordia"
								/>
								<img
									class="exp-hero-still"
									src={fullPoster}
									alt=""
									width="1920"
									height="1080"
									decoding="async"
									loading="lazy"
								/>
								<button class="exp-play" type="button" data-exp-play aria-label="Play video">
									<span data-exp-play-label>Play film</span>
								</button>
								<div
									class="exp-hero-load"
									data-exp-load
									role="progressbar"
									aria-label="Film download"
									aria-valuemin="0"
									aria-valuemax="100"
									aria-valuenow="0"
								>
									<span class="exp-hero-load-bar" data-exp-load-bar />
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
						<p class="exp-hero-credit">Film by Santiago Marrodán Ciordia</p>
					</div>
				</section>
			)
		}

		<section class="exp-block" id="in-the-field" aria-labelledby="field-heading">
			<div class="page-narrow">
				<p class="label">In the Field</p>
				<h2 id="field-heading">Preparation and observation.</h2>
				<p>
					From assembling the instruments to the minutes on site — Padilla de Abajo and Pico Trigaza,
					side by side.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="exp-field-grid" data-lightbox-gallery aria-label="Preparation and observation photographs">
				{
					fieldBeats.map((beat) => (
						<figure class="exp-field-shot" style={`--shot-pos: ${beat.position}`}>
							<button
								type="button"
								class="exp-field-shot-open"
								data-lightbox-trigger
								aria-label={`View larger: ${beat.label}. ${beat.caption}`}
							>
								<Image
									src={beat.image}
									alt={beat.alt}
									widths={[480, 800, 1200]}
									sizes="(max-width: 900px) 46vw, 22vw"
									loading="lazy"
									class="exp-field-photo"
								/>
							</button>
							<figcaption>
								<strong>{beat.label}</strong>
								<span>{beat.note}</span>
								<span class="exp-field-credit" data-lightbox-caption-text>
									{beat.caption}
								</span>
							</figcaption>
						</figure>
					))
				}
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="exp-block" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-heading">
			<div class="page-narrow">
				<p class="label">The Expedition Team</p>
				<h2 id="team-heading">Who was in the field.</h2>
				<p>The people who took part in the Burgos expedition, listed by observing site.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="exp-team-group">
				<p class="label">Padilla de Abajo</p>
				<ul class="exp-team-grid">
					{
						padillaTeam.map((member) => (
							<li class="exp-team-card">
								<div class="exp-well exp-well--portrait">
									<Image
										src={member.photo}
										alt={member.name}
										widths={[320, 480, 720]}
										sizes="(max-width: 640px) 90vw, (max-width: 900px) 44vw, 22vw"
									/>
								</div>
								<h3>{member.name}</h3>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>

			<div class="exp-team-group">
				<p class="label">Pico Trigaza</p>
				<ul class="exp-team-grid">
					{
						trigazaTeam.map((member) => (
							<li class="exp-team-card">
								<div class="exp-well exp-well--portrait exp-well--empty">
									<p class="exp-well-label">Portrait</p>
								</div>
								<h3>{member.name}</h3>
								{'note' in member && member.note ? <p class="exp-team-note">{member.note}</p> : null}
								{'href' in member && member.href ? (
									<a
										class="exp-team-link"
										href={member.href}
										rel="noopener noreferrer"
										target="_blank"
									>
										{member.linkLabel} <span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
									</a>
								) : null}
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="exp-block exp-partners" id="made-possible-by" aria-labelledby="partners-heading">
			<div class="page-narrow">
				<p class="label">Made Possible By</p>
				<h2 id="partners-heading">The support that put this expedition in the field.</h2>
				<!--
					Editorial (not public): former note that logos match the rest of the site, and that
					Valmala local supporters will be added when confirmed. Thank-you copy below is proposed —
					confirm with Danilo before publish.
				-->
				<p>
					Thank you to the institutions, technical partners and local supporters who helped make the
					Burgos 2026 expedition possible.
				</p>
			</div>
			<PartnerLogos include={[...burgosPartnerIds]} />
		</section>

		<section class="exp-block exp-podcast" id="podcast" aria-labelledby="podcast-heading" data-podcast>
			<div class="exp-podcast-panel">
				<div class="exp-podcast-layout">
					<div class="exp-podcast-copy">
						<p class="label">Podcast</p>
						<h2 id="podcast-heading">{podcast.title}</h2>
						<div class="exp-podcast-byline">
							<figure class="exp-podcast-byline-photo">
								<Image
									src={ignacioAmigo}
									alt=""
									widths={[96, 160, 240]}
									sizes="48px"
								/>
							</figure>
							<p class="exp-podcast-byline-text">
								<a href={podcast.authorUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">{podcast.author}</a>
							</p>
						</div>
						<p>
							Science writer Ignacio Amigo joined the expedition in Padilla de Abajo, recording
							conversations with the researchers and the sounds of eclipse day.
						</p>
						<p class="exp-podcast-about">
							<a href={podcast.authorUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">About Ignacio</a>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="exp-podcast-listen-col">
						<div class="exp-podcast-langs" data-podcast-langs role="group" aria-label="Episode language">
							{
								podcast.languages.map((language, index) => (
									<button
										type="button"
										class="exp-site-btn"
										data-podcast-lang={language.id}
										data-episode={language.episodeId}
										data-spotify={language.spotifyUrl}
										data-iframe-title={language.iframeTitle}
										aria-pressed={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
									>
										{language.label}
									</button>
								))
							}
						</div>
						<p class="exp-podcast-duration">{podcast.durationLabel}</p>
						<div class="exp-podcast-player">
							<iframe
								data-podcast-frame
								src={`https://open.spotify.com/embed/episode/${podcastDefault.episodeId}?utm_source=generator&theme=0`}
								title={podcastDefault.iframeTitle}
								width="100%"
								height="152"
								allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
								loading="lazy"
							></iframe>
						</div>
						<p class="exp-podcast-listen">
							<a
								data-podcast-listen
								href={podcastDefault.spotifyUrl}
								rel="noopener noreferrer"
								target="_blank"
							>
								Listen on Spotify <span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
							</a>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="exp-processed" id="processed-images" aria-labelledby="processed-heading">
			<div class="exp-section-inner exp-processed-layout">
				<figure class="exp-processed-media">
					<Image
						class="exp-processed-photo"
						src={burgosProcessedCorona}
						alt="Processed white-light image of the solar corona during the 2026 total solar eclipse"
						widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
						sizes="(max-width: 900px) 92vw, 52vw"
					/>
					<figcaption class="exp-processed-credit">
						© 2026 Miloslav Druckmüller, Shadia Habbal, Zdeněk Sobotka
					</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<div class="exp-processed-copy">
					<p class="label">Processed Eclipse Images</p>
					<h2 id="processed-heading">A closer look at the solar corona.</h2>
					<p>
						A processed image of the 2026 total solar eclipse by{' '}
						<a href={druckmullerSite} rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"
							>Miloslav Druckmüller</a
						>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="exp-next" id="what-comes-next" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
			<div class="exp-next-panel">
				<p class="label">Next Expedition</p>
				<h2 id="next-heading">2 August 2027.</h2>
				<p class="exp-next-lead">
					The next campaign will bring the Sherpas to Egypt, southern Spain and Tunisia.
				</p>
				<ul class="exp-next-places">
					{
						nextPlaces.map((place) => (
							<li>
								<span>{place.label}</span>
								<span class="exp-next-status">{place.status}</span>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="exp-invite" id="support" aria-labelledby="invite-heading">
			<!--
				Editorial (not public): Patreon / Buy Me a Coffee / four support types stay on Home #support.
			-->
			<div class="exp-section-inner exp-invite-inner">
				<p class="label">Support Our Work</p>
				<h2 id="invite-heading">Help make eclipse science possible.</h2>
				<p>
					Help sustain the expeditions, instruments and research that deepen our understanding of the
					Sun.
				</p>
				<div class="exp-invite-actions">
					<a class="cta cta--button" href="/#support">
						Explore ways to support <span class="cta-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
					</a>
					<a class="exp-invite-secondary" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
						Discuss a partnership
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<HomeConnect />

		<dialog class="about-lightbox" data-about-lightbox aria-label="Photo gallery">
			<button type="button" class="about-lightbox-close" data-lightbox-close aria-label="Close gallery">
				<span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
			</button>
			<button
				type="button"
				class="about-lightbox-nav about-lightbox-nav--prev"
				data-lightbox-prev
				aria-label="Previous photo"
			>
				<span aria-hidden="true">‹</span>
			</button>
			<button
				type="button"
				class="about-lightbox-nav about-lightbox-nav--next"
				data-lightbox-next
				aria-label="Next photo"
			>
				<span aria-hidden="true">›</span>
			</button>
			<div class="about-lightbox-stage" data-lightbox-stage>
				<img class="about-lightbox-image" data-lightbox-image alt="" />
				<div class="about-lightbox-meta">
					<p class="about-lightbox-caption" data-lightbox-caption></p>
					<p class="about-lightbox-counter" data-lightbox-counter></p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</dialog>
	</article>
</BaseLayout>
